a lot because we were dealing with lists. So just sort of zooming out a little bit,

02:03:53.899 --> 02:03:58.800
these are the kinds of emptiness we could have, so nill could be an empty list. Null

02:03:58.800 --> 02:04:07.579
is an empty reference. None is an empty option and unit always has this, we represent, this

02:04:07.579 --> 02:04:14.500
is the value that's represented by these two parens. These are the corresponding things.

02:04:14.500 --> 02:04:20.260
So this is using null here because over in Java, oh, it's because it's using this code,

02:04:20.260 --> 02:04:21.260
right?

