So in this code, the corresponding in Scala, we use nil for empty list.

02:04:43.760 --> 02:04:47.920
and we use null to represent emptiness in a list here,

02:04:49.260 --> 02:04:52.699
and null is always gonna be an empty reference, of course.

02:04:52.699 --> 02:04:54.739
So that works.

02:04:56.360 --> 02:04:58.360
Java added optional.

02:04:58.360 --> 02:05:01.920
This is corresponding to our option in Scala.

