x.get, val y equals so y is going to have type x. So it's going to unwrap the option

02:08:29.340 --> 02:08:35.659
And it will throw a no such element exception if it's a none.

02:08:35.659 --> 02:08:38.460
So that's why you might get this exception here.

02:08:38.460 --> 02:08:40.739
Same idea.

02:08:40.739 --> 02:08:41.960
This could be a safe call.

02:08:41.960 --> 02:08:46.199
So you're basically saying give me the length.

02:08:46.199 --> 02:08:47.260
Oh, it shows you.

02:08:47.260 --> 02:08:49.000
It explicitly expands it to this.

02:08:49.000 --> 02:08:53.860
So if b is not null, b.length, otherwise null.

