you often have in your runtime environment.

02:14:15.440 --> 02:14:16.480
You have logging levels.

02:14:16.619 --> 02:14:17.640
I don't know if you're familiar with that,

02:14:17.699 --> 02:14:19.440
but you have debug level,

02:14:19.659 --> 02:14:22.699
and you have info and warning and error,

